      "dct:description": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Linked Geodesy Research Project topi.link combines geodesy and Linked Data research questions. Using the Academic\nMeta Tool (AMT), we have a little minion, which addresses the task of inferencing vague graph data. topi.link will give\naccess to the AMT world using toponyms as a graph-based vague topology for these toponyms. This paper demonstrates a\nvery simple example how to model a north/south ontology using AMT."
      },
